{
  "_comment": [
    "Test corpus of community surf maps. BSPs are NOT committed (see .gitignore);",
    "fetch them with `python3 tools/fetch_maps.py --all`, which verifies every",
    "download against the sha256 below.",
    "",
    "These hashes pin the exact recompile that assets/zones/*.json AABBs,",
    "assets/fixtures/ksf_resim_baselines.json, and the surf-map tests were built",
    "against. A mirror silently serving a different build of a map would move",
    "spawns and zone volumes without any other signal. Do not update a hash",
    "without re-deriving that map's zones and re-checking its tests."
  ],
  "source": "https://main.fastdl.me/maps/<name>.bsp.bz2",
  "_required_by_tests_comment": [
    "`cargo test --workspace` loads these maps and will FAIL without them —",
    "by design, we require the corpus rather than silently skipping coverage.",
    "Fetch with `python3 tools/fetch_maps.py --batch tests`.",
    "surf-app's KSF resim/audio tests additionally need assets/replays/external/,",
    "which is local-only and not fetchable; those tests self-skip when it's absent."
  ],
  "required_by_tests": [
    "surf_boreas",
    "surf_cement",
    "surf_cyberwave",
    "surf_fornax",
    "surf_frost",
    "surf_lovetunnel",
    "surf_overgrowth",
    "surf_summit",
    "surf_tendies"
  ],
